  "reflectionText": "Paul charged Timothy: flee these things. Follow after righteousness, godliness, faith, love, perseverance, gentleness. Fight the good fight of faith. Take hold of the eternal life to which you were called. What is it to be charged to take hold of a life you were called into, before you have finished the fight that is still in front of you?"
